                    <div id="content-body" class="clearfix container my-5">

                <div class="row">
                                                                                
                    <div id="content" class="layout-content col-12 col-lg-12 order-lg-1 order-0">
                          <div>
    
<div id="block-fawn-page-title">
  
    
      
  <h1><span class="field field-name-title">Computer Science</span>
</h1>


  </div>
<div id="block-fawn-content" class="main-block">
  
    
      <article>

    
        

    
    <div class="node-content-wrapper " >
          <div class="layout layout--twocol-section layout--twocol-section--75-25">

          <div  class="layout__region layout__region--first">
        <div>
  
    
      
                        <div class="field field-name-body"><div class="tex2jax_process"><div class="content-grid row"><div class="col-12 col-md-6 content-grid-item"><p>Explore machine learning. Investigate how robots move and operate. Or, b<span>uild a robot and experiment with AI.</span></p><p><span>Studying </span>computer science<span> gives you the tools to power tomorrow's technology.</span></p><p><a class="btn btn-action" href="https://www.utm.utoronto.ca/future-students/events/campus-tours"><i class="fa-solid fa-person-walking"></i> Book a campus tour</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="btn btn-action" href="https://www.utm.utoronto.ca/future-students/admissions/application-process"><i class="fa-regular fa-paper-plane"></i> How to apply</a></p></div><div class="col-12 col-md-6 content-grid-item"><div>
  
  
                        <div class="field field-name-field-media-image">    <picture>
                  <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xxl/public/2025-09/UofT95977_UTM%20Robotics_Volpe_Feb%202023-43.jpg.jpeg.webp?itok=m_NtOkqz 1x, /future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xxxl/public/2025-09/UofT95977_UTM%20Robotics_Volpe_Feb%202023-43.jpg.jpeg.webp?itok=cE60N30i 2x" media="all and (min-width: 992px)" type="image/webp" width="1296" height="704">
              <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xl/public/2025-09/UofT95977_UTM%20Robotics_Volpe_Feb%202023-43.jpg.jpeg.webp?itok=seM0z_IH 1x, /future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xxl/public/2025-09/UofT95977_UTM%20Robotics_Volpe_Feb%202023-43.jpg.jpeg.webp?itok=m_NtOkqz 2x" media="all and (min-width: 768px)" type="image/webp" width="1296" height="704">
              <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_l/public/2025-09/UofT95977_UTM%20Robotics_Volpe_Feb%202023-43.jpg.jpeg.webp?itok=mTvkLIB7 1x, /future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xl/public/2025-09/UofT95977_UTM%20Robotics_Volpe_Feb%202023-43.jpg.jpeg.webp?itok=seM0z_IH 2x" type="image/webp" width="960" height="521">
                  <img loading="lazy" width="720" height="391" src="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_m/public/2025-09/UofT95977_UTM%20Robotics_Volpe_Feb%202023-43.jpg.jpeg.webp?itok=RfLmGatd" alt="Researchers working with robotics at UTM's robotics lab">

  </picture>

</div>
            
</div>
</div></div><h2><strong>On this page</strong></h2><div class="content-grid row"><div class="col-12 col-md-3 content-grid-item"><p><a href="#computer-science-programs">Computer Science programs</a></p><hr><p><a href="#beyond-the-classroom">Beyond the classroom</a></p></div><div class="col-12 col-md-3 content-grid-item"><p><a href="#meet-your-community">Meet your community</a></p><hr><p><a href="#research-in-action">Research in action</a></p></div><div class="col-12 col-md-3 content-grid-item"><p><a href="#career-opportunities">Career opportunities</a></p><hr><p><a href="#learning-pathways">Learning pathways</a></p></div><div class="col-12 col-md-3 content-grid-item"><p><a href="#you-might-also-like">You might also like</a></p><hr><p><a href="#stay-connected">Stay connected</a></p></div></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class="content-grid row"><div class="col-12 col-md-4 content-grid-item"><div class="bg-light p-3"><h2><strong>#1 in Canada for data science and AI</strong></h2><p><span>ahead of University of British Columbia and McGill University</span><a href="https://www.topuniversities.com/university-subject-rankings/data-science-artificial-intelligence"><span>*</span></a></p></div></div><div class="col-12 col-md-4 content-grid-item"><div class="bg-light p-3"><h2><strong>#10 globally in data science and AI</strong></h2><p><span>ahead of Imperial College and University College London</span><a href="https://www.topuniversities.com/university-subject-rankings/data-science-artificial-intelligence"><span>**</span></a></p></div></div><div class="col-12 col-md-4 content-grid-item"><div class="bg-light p-3"><h2><strong>#12 globally in computer science</strong></h2><p><span>ahead of Princeton University and Yale University</span><a href="https://www.topuniversities.com/university-subject-rankings/computer-science-information-systems"><span>***</span></a></p></div></div></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><a class="anchor" id="computer-science-programs" name="computer-science-programs"></a><strong>Computer Science programs</strong></h2><hr><div class="content-grid row"><div class="col-12 col-md-3 content-grid-item"><div class="bg-light p-3"><h3><a href="https://www.utm.utoronto.ca/future-students/programs/computer-science"><strong>Computer Science</strong></a> (Specialist, Major)</h3><p><span>Explore robotics, human-computer interaction, software engineering, numerical analysis, AI, cryptography and more with this cutting-edge program.</span></p><div>
  
  
                        <div class="field field-name-field-media-image">    <picture>
                  <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/landscape_xl/public/2025-09/UofT95974_UTM%20Robotics_Volpe_Feb%202023-18_lpr.jpg.jpeg.webp?h=3b5d1417&amp;itok=u3q2s0zt 1x" media="all and (min-width: 992px)" type="image/webp" width="1600" height="1200">
              <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/landscape_l/public/2025-09/UofT95974_UTM%20Robotics_Volpe_Feb%202023-18_lpr.jpg.jpeg.webp?h=3b5d1417&amp;itok=t2l8utDc 1x, /future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/landscape_xl/public/2025-09/UofT95974_UTM%20Robotics_Volpe_Feb%202023-18_lpr.jpg.jpeg.webp?h=3b5d1417&amp;itok=u3q2s0zt 2x" media="all and (min-width: 768px)" type="image/webp" width="800" height="600">
              <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/landscape/public/2025-09/UofT95974_UTM%20Robotics_Volpe_Feb%202023-18_lpr.jpg.jpeg.webp?h=3b5d1417&amp;itok=ia2cSbmd 1x, /future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/landscape_l/public/2025-09/UofT95974_UTM%20Robotics_Volpe_Feb%202023-18_lpr.jpg.jpeg.webp?h=3b5d1417&amp;itok=t2l8utDc 2x" type="image/webp" width="400" height="300">
                  <img loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" src="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/landscape/public/2025-09/UofT95974_UTM%20Robotics_Volpe_Feb%202023-18_lpr.jpg.jpeg.webp?h=3b5d1417&amp;itok=ia2cSbmd" alt="Student working on robot in UTM's Continuum robotics lab">

  </picture>

</div>
            
</div>
</div></div><div class="col-12 col-md-3 content-grid-item"><div class="bg-light p-3"><h3><a href="https://www.utm.utoronto.ca/future-students/programs/information-security"><strong>Information Security</strong></a></h3><p><span>Discover digital forensics, common software development flaws and how to prevent social engineering attacks with this engaging program.</span></p><div>
  
  
                        <div class="field field-name-field-media-image">    <picture>
                  <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/landscape_xl/public/2025-09/Visualization%20Facility.jpeg.webp?h=3b5d1417&amp;itok=OkAjfBgo 1x" media="all and (min-width: 992px)" type="image/webp" width="1600" height="1200">
              <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/landscape_l/public/2025-09/Visualization%20Facility.jpeg.webp?h=3b5d1417&amp;itok=6--OtigX 1x, /future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/landscape_xl/public/2025-09/Visualization%20Facility.jpeg.webp?h=3b5d1417&amp;itok=OkAjfBgo 2x" media="all and (min-width: 768px)" type="image/webp" width="800" height="600">
              <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/landscape/public/2025-09/Visualization%20Facility.jpeg.webp?h=3b5d1417&amp;itok=OwGljL3I 1x, /future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/landscape_l/public/2025-09/Visualization%20Facility.jpeg.webp?h=3b5d1417&amp;itok=6--OtigX 2x" type="image/webp" width="400" height="300">
                  <img loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" src="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/landscape/public/2025-09/Visualization%20Facility.jpeg.webp?h=3b5d1417&amp;itok=OwGljL3I" alt="Students and professor examining data points on digital screen in visualization facility">

  </picture>

</div>
            
</div>
</div></div><div class="col-12 col-md-3 content-grid-item"><p>&nbsp;</p></div><div class="col-12 col-md-3 content-grid-item"><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><a class="anchor" id="beyond-the-classroom" name="beyond-the-classroom"></a><strong>Beyond the classroom</strong></h2><hr><div class="content-grid row"><div class="col-12 col-md-4 content-grid-item"><div class="bg-light p-3"><div>
  
  
                        <div class="field field-name-field-media-image">    <picture>
                  <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/landscape_xl/public/2025-09/UofT95976_UTM%20Robotics_Volpe_Feb%202023-39_lpr.jpg.jpeg.webp?h=3b5d1417&amp;itok=xYpzcWux 1x" media="all and (min-width: 992px)" type="image/webp" width="1600" height="1200">
