<h3><strong>Academic groups and societies</strong></h3><p><span>Explore a range of computer science student organizations at UTM, from the Robotics Club to Women in Science and Computing and more.</span></p><p><a class="btn btn-action-block" href="https://sop.utoronto.ca/groups/?areas_of_interest=academic&amp;campus=utm"><span>View academic groups at UTM</span></a></p></div></div></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><a class="anchor" id="meet-your-community" name="meet-your-community"></a><strong>Meet your community</strong></h2><hr><div class="content-grid row"><div class="col-12 col-md-6 content-grid-item"><div class="bg-light p-3"><div class="align-right">
  
  
                        <div class="field field-name-field-media-image">    <picture>
                  <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xxl/public/2025-09/VaneezehSiddiqui.png.webp?itok=GtINxXzf 1x, /future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xxxl/public/2025-09/VaneezehSiddiqui.png.webp?itok=gjUnaH8T 2x" media="all and (min-width: 992px)" type="image/webp" width="456" height="456">
