<p class="center"><span lang="EN-US">"</span><span>I took a broad range of courses outside of my requirements to get exposure to various ways of thinking [...] I also launched the Women in Science and Computing team, which is where I learned how to execute big ideas and work within cross-functional teams. These skills served me well as I entered the professional world</span><span lang="EN-US">."</span></p><p class="person center"><a href="https://www.utm.utoronto.ca/math-cs-stats/vaneezeh-siddiqui">Vaneezeh Siddiqui</a>, <span>HBSc '23</span></p></div></div><div class="col-12 col-md-6 content-grid-item"><div class="bg-light p-3"><div class="align-right">
  
  
                        <div class="field field-name-field-media-image">    <picture>
                  <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xxl/public/2025-09/AlexandraThompson.png.webp?itok=6UvB8rvS 1x, /future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xxxl/public/2025-09/AlexandraThompson.png.webp?itok=TWBwFuKx 2x" media="all and (min-width: 992px)" type="image/webp" width="726" height="726">
              <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xl/public/2025-09/AlexandraThompson.png.webp?itok=9QMjTnCA 1x, /future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xxl/public/2025-09/AlexandraThompson.png.webp?itok=6UvB8rvS 2x" media="all and (min-width: 768px)" type="image/webp" width="726" height="726">
              <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_l/public/2025-09/AlexandraThompson.png.webp?itok=SiImlX0a 1x, /future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xl/public/2025-09/AlexandraThompson.png.webp?itok=9QMjTnCA 2x" type="image/webp" width="726" height="726">
