  </picture>

</div>
            
</div>
<p class="center"><span>“While at UTM, I spent a lot of time as a teaching assistant [...] I was really interested in becoming a professor and computer science courses at UTM really prepared me for graduate school. My undergraduate research experience [also] gave me the skills I needed to excel in my PhD program.”&nbsp;</span></p><p class="person center"><a href="https://www.utm.utoronto.ca/math-cs-stats/alexandra-thompson">Alexandra Thompson</a>, <span>HBSc '22</span></p></div></div></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><a class="anchor" id="research-in-action" name="research-in-action"></a><strong>Research in action</strong></h2><hr><div class="content-grid row"><div class="col-12 col-md-4 content-grid-item"><div>
  
  
