</div>
            
</div>
<h3><strong>Featured career: Co-Founder and Chief Executive Officer</strong></h3><p>Aidan Gomez<span> is the co-founder and CEO ofCohere, a billion dollar AI research lab with offices in Toronto, San Francisco, London and New York. Cohere was founded by three graduates of computer science.</span></p><p><a class="btn btn-action" href="https://web.cs.toronto.edu/news-events/news/u-of-t-computer-science-faculty-and-alumnus-among-the-50-most-influential-torontonians">Read more about Gomez and Cohere</a></p></div></div></div><h2><a class="anchor" id="learning-pathways" name="learning-pathways"></a><strong>Learning pathways</strong></h2><hr><div class="content-grid row"><div class="col-12 col-md-6 content-grid-item"><div>
  
  
                        <div class="field field-name-field-media-image">    <picture>
                  <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xxl/public/2025-09/UofT96221_Visualization%20Facility_Kundur%20Class_March%202023_2_Volpe%20%281%29.jpg.jpeg.webp?itok=WH920ptu 1x, /future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xxxl/public/2025-09/UofT96221_Visualization%20Facility_Kundur%20Class_March%202023_2_Volpe%20%281%29.jpg.jpeg.webp?itok=-0zPtOBp 2x" media="all and (min-width: 992px)" type="image/webp" width="1296" height="892">
              <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xl/public/2025-09/UofT96221_Visualization%20Facility_Kundur%20Class_March%202023_2_Volpe%20%281%29.jpg.jpeg.webp?itok=yme5Es0- 1x, /future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xxl/public/2025-09/UofT96221_Visualization%20Facility_Kundur%20Class_March%202023_2_Volpe%20%281%29.jpg.jpeg.webp?itok=WH920ptu 2x" media="all and (min-width: 768px)" type="image/webp" width="1296" height="892">
